      "filename": "Battle of Lepanto 1571.jpg",
      "title": "File:Battle of Lepanto 1571.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Battle_of_Lepanto_1571.jpg",
